WEBVTT

00:37.670 --> 00:41.390
<b>ORIGINAL WORK
TATSUKI FUJIMOTO</b>

00:37.670 --> 00:41.390
<b>(SERIALIZED IN SHUEISHA'S SHONEN JUMP+)</b>

01:07.420 --> 01:09.250
<b><i>It's that same dream again.</i></b>

01:09.960 --> 01:13.290
<b><i>It's that same dream I always dream...</i>
<i>And always forget.</i></b>

01:21.250 --> 01:22.250
<b>Denji.</b>

01:24.750 --> 01:25.920
<b>Pochita!</b>

01:26.630 --> 01:28.380
<b>Pochita, come out!</b>

01:28.880 --> 01:31.250
<b>We're just in a dream right now.
Let me pet you.</b>

01:31.330 --> 01:32.500
<b>Denji.</b>

01:38.580 --> 01:40.250
<b>Do not open the door. No matter what.</b>

02:01.130 --> 02:03.790
<b>What's going on? You're so loud.</b>

02:06.000 --> 02:07.540
<b>I had a bad dream.</b>

02:17.170 --> 02:18.290
<b>Am I still in a dream?</b>

02:18.830 --> 02:20.290
<b>What are you talking about?</b>

02:27.670 --> 02:29.130
<b>What's going on?</b>

02:29.210 --> 02:32.380
<b>Where did I get all this power?</b>

02:33.790 --> 02:36.080
<b>So this isn't a dream.</b>

02:57.580 --> 02:58.030
<b>CHAINSAW MAN{}</b>

03:05.170 --> 03:06.880
<b>Public Safety Devil Hunters
Large-Scale Attack</b>

04:33.960 --> 04:34.960
<b>ONE MOMENT PLEASE</b>

05:05.750 --> 05:08.750
<b>CHAINSAW MAN - THE MOVIE:</b>

05:05.750 --> 05:08.750
<b>REZE ARC</b>

05:11.580 --> 05:14.040
<b>Devil Hunter Tokyo HQ Building</b>

05:18.420 --> 05:20.040
<b>What are these horns?</b>

05:20.130 --> 05:23.290
<b>Power, you drank too much blood,
didn't you?</b>

05:23.960 --> 05:27.040
<b>Maybe you drank too much blood
in that fight against the zombies.</b>

05:27.790 --> 05:30.670
<b>-We've got to drain some blood out of you.
-Okay!</b>

05:31.290 --> 05:32.460
<b>Drain her blood?</b>

05:32.540 --> 05:35.040
<b>Power has to have her blood drained
every once in a while,</b>

05:35.830 --> 05:40.170
<b>or else she becomes even more scary
and self-centered than she normally is.</b>

05:40.880 --> 05:42.790
<b>So that's why... Denji...</b>

05:42.880 --> 05:45.170
<b>Is it okay if I borrow Power for a while?</b>

05:51.630 --> 05:53.170
<b>Take as long as you need.</b>

05:55.290 --> 05:57.960
<b>As for who's going to be your new buddy
while I'm borrowing her,</b>

05:58.630 --> 06:00.880
<b>this guy said
he wants to team up with you.</b>

06:06.130 --> 06:08.500
<b>Lord Chainsaw! Lord Chainsaw!</b>

06:13.170 --> 06:15.290
<b>Who is this guy?</b>

06:16.000 --> 06:17.080
<b>He's the Shark Fiend.</b>

06:17.670 --> 06:20.540
<b>Normally, he's so ferocious that no one
can even have a conversation with him.</b>

06:20.630 --> 06:22.880
<b>But he said that as long as he gets
to pair up with you, Denji,</b>

06:22.960 --> 06:25.880
<b>-he'll do whatever you tell him to.
-He'll do whatever I tell him to do?</b>

06:26.460 --> 06:28.920
<b>-How come?
-I'm not sure.</b>

06:29.000 --> 06:30.420
<b>Maybe it's because your faces look alike.</b>

06:30.500 --> 06:33.420
<b>Lord Chainsaw! I'll do whatever you say!
No matter what! Lord Chainsaw!</b>

06:33.500 --> 06:36.420
<b>You're the best! You're the greatest!
Lord Chainsaw! You're the greatest!</b>

06:36.500 --> 06:39.080
<b>Don't touch me! I'm not into men.</b>

06:45.170 --> 06:47.540
<b>You look unhappy.</b>

06:49.790 --> 06:51.710
<b>I feel great.</b>

06:55.830 --> 06:57.540
<b>If you really are feeling great,</b>

06:57.630 --> 07:00.460
<b>then how about going on a date
with me tomorrow on our day off?</b>

07:01.420 --> 07:02.460
<b>A date?</b>

07:06.460 --> 07:09.960
<b>Hooray! Hooray!</b>

07:11.460 --> 07:13.710
<b>Huh? Denji, you're already here.</b>

07:14.290 --> 07:16.330
<b>You're an hour early.</b>

07:19.710 --> 07:22.040
<b><i>She's so cute! She's so cute!</i></b>

07:22.130 --> 07:23.880
<b>She's so cute!</b>

07:24.460 --> 07:26.540
<b>Denji, what time did you get here?</b>

07:26.630 --> 07:29.080
<b>I couldn't sleep last night.
I got here at 5:00.</b>

07:29.670 --> 07:32.080
<b>So... what's the plan for today?</b>

07:32.960 --> 07:36.250
<b>I've never hung out with a girl before.</b>

07:37.080 --> 07:42.500
<b>Today, from now until midnight,
we're going to go movie-theater hopping.</b>

07:43.750 --> 07:44.750
<b>What?</b>

07:54.000 --> 07:55.000
<b><i>Well...</i></b>

07:55.080 --> 07:57.420
<b><i>this isn't what I was expecting.</i></b>

08:01.210 --> 08:02.880
<b><i>Everyone's laughing.</i></b>

08:02.960 --> 08:05.420
<b><i>It wasn't that funny!</i></b>

08:10.500 --> 08:12.790
<b><i>Makima's not laughing either.</i></b>

08:13.540 --> 08:15.170
<b><i>She's so cute.</i></b>

08:17.330 --> 08:18.960
<b>That was disappointing.</b>

08:19.460 --> 08:21.130
<b>It wasn't very interesting at all.</b>

08:21.210 --> 08:24.170
<b>It looked like they spent a lot of money
making that movie though.</b>

08:25.670 --> 08:28.040
<b>Well, then... let's go to the next one.</b>

08:38.880 --> 08:40.040
<b><i>Everyone's crying.</i></b>

08:42.920 --> 08:44.750
<b><i>She's not crying.</i></b>

08:44.830 --> 08:45.830
<b><i>She's so cute.</i></b>

08:47.170 --> 08:49.170
<b>That was disappointing.</b>

08:49.250 --> 08:52.960
<b>I didn't like how it felt when
they were trying to force us to cry.</b>

08:57.040 --> 08:59.210
<b>At least the music was good.</b>

09:01.540 --> 09:03.830
<b>The story seemed so fake.</b>

09:08.750 --> 09:10.830
<b>It was just average.</b>

09:11.460 --> 09:13.210
<b>The next movie is the last one.</b>

09:13.290 --> 09:14.290
<b>CINEMA</b>

09:14.380 --> 09:17.670
<b>Everyone says this movie
is hard to understand.</b>

09:18.790 --> 09:20.420
<b>Do you want to try watching it, Denji?</b>

09:22.920 --> 09:26.250
<b>Honestly, all the movies
we've seen today were bad.</b>

09:26.330 --> 09:29.130
<b>Maybe I don't get movies or something.</b>

09:29.920 --> 09:34.540
<b>I only find one good movie
for every ten movies I watch too.</b>

09:35.920 --> 09:40.250
<b>But one of those
was a movie that changed my life.</b>

10:29.460 --> 10:32.040
<b><i>This scene isn't even that important.</i></b>

10:32.670 --> 10:35.080
<b><i>I hope Makima doesn't see me!</i></b>

10:53.290 --> 10:57.080
<b>I'm never going to forget that last scene
until the day I die.</b>

10:57.170 --> 10:58.330
<b>Me too.</b>

10:58.420 --> 11:01.170
<b>That last movie made
the price of the ticket worth it.</b>

11:05.170 --> 11:08.920
<b>Makima, do you think I have a heart?</b>

11:10.170 --> 11:12.170
<b>Why are you asking that question?</b>

11:13.580 --> 11:14.630
<b>Just because.</b>

11:38.330 --> 11:39.330
<b>You do.</b>

11:40.750 --> 11:41.750
<b>I...</b>

11:42.750 --> 11:44.170
<b>I do.</b>

12:12.380 --> 12:13.710
<b><i>I see...</i></b>

12:13.790 --> 12:17.960
<b><i>The fact that I felt butterflies</i>
<i>means that I do have a heart!</i></b>

12:18.040 --> 12:19.210
<b>Donations, please!</b>

12:19.290 --> 12:21.040
<b>-Donations, please!
-Donations, please!</b>

12:21.130 --> 12:24.960
<b>We're collecting donations for children
who've been victimized by devils.</b>

12:25.630 --> 12:27.130
<b>Donations, please!</b>

12:27.210 --> 12:30.040
<b>I have a heart,
so I can even make a donation!</b>

12:31.540 --> 12:32.790
<b>Thank you very much!</b>

12:33.420 --> 12:36.540
<b>We're giving away flowers
to everyone who makes a donation.</b>

12:39.500 --> 12:40.500
<b>It's beautiful.</b>

12:47.380 --> 12:49.380
<b><i>And the fact that</i>
<i>I can feel that the flower is beautiful</i></b>

12:49.460 --> 12:51.790
<b><i>also means I have a heart!</i></b>

12:54.830 --> 12:56.830
<b><i>Makima, you're incredible.</i></b>

12:57.960 --> 13:00.670
<b><i>I feel so much better</i>
<i>after talking to you!</i></b>

13:02.580 --> 13:06.580
<b><i>Makima said that once I've gathered</i>
<i>all the pieces of the Gun Devil's flesh,</i></b>

13:06.670 --> 13:08.130
<b><i>she'll grant me one wish.</i></b>

13:08.210 --> 13:12.080
<b><i>In that case... I think I want</i>
<i>to ask her to be my girlfriend.</i></b>

13:21.250 --> 13:24.540
<b><i>Whenever I have a free moment,</i>
<i>I always start thinking about Makima.</i></b>

13:24.630 --> 13:28.380
<b><i>I've squeezed other girls' boobs</i>
<i>and kissed other girls before too,</i></b>

13:28.460 --> 13:31.170
<b><i>but my heart belongs completely to Makima!</i></b>

13:31.790 --> 13:34.880
<b><i>There's no way I'm going</i>
<i>to fall for anyone else!</i></b>

13:39.460 --> 13:41.130
<b>Run away!</b>

13:42.290 --> 13:43.380
<b>Whoo-hoo!</b>

13:43.460 --> 13:44.670
<b>Water! Water!</b>

13:44.750 --> 13:47.500
<b>Water!</b>

13:50.080 --> 13:52.580
<b>Beam! You stay hidden!</b>

13:52.670 --> 13:55.670
<b>If anyone sees you, I won't be able
to walk around in public anymore.</b>

13:55.750 --> 13:56.750
<b>Okay!</b>

13:58.880 --> 14:02.170
<b>Why do fiends all have such weird names?</b>

14:14.540 --> 14:17.170
<b>I should have brought an umbrella.</b>

14:31.250 --> 14:32.710
<b>Hello, hello.</b>

14:33.290 --> 14:35.420
<b>It's raining so hard.</b>

14:39.000 --> 14:40.960
<b>The weather report said...</b>

14:48.210 --> 14:49.630
<b>Huh? What's wrong?</b>

14:50.130 --> 14:51.960
<b>Sorry.</b>

14:53.380 --> 14:54.880
<b>What's wrong with you?</b>

14:59.710 --> 15:02.380
<b>Huh? How come you're crying?</b>

15:02.460 --> 15:04.080
<b>Sorry.</b>

15:04.830 --> 15:06.040
<b>Your face...</b>

15:06.630 --> 15:09.080
<b>looks like my dog that passed away.</b>

15:10.130 --> 15:12.330
<b>You're saying I'm a dog?</b>

15:12.420 --> 15:14.960
<b>I'm sorry! I'm sorry!</b>

15:20.250 --> 15:21.330
<b>Are you okay?</b>

15:28.000 --> 15:30.460
<b>Hold on! I've got a handkerchief!</b>

15:33.040 --> 15:34.790
<b>Ta-da!</b>

15:35.460 --> 15:36.920
<b>What?</b>

15:37.000 --> 15:38.040
<b>A magic trick?</b>

15:38.750 --> 15:40.040
<b>That's amazing!</b>

15:40.880 --> 15:43.380
<b>There's no trick to it.</b>

15:47.170 --> 15:48.380
<b>Thanks.</b>

16:02.630 --> 16:04.460
<b>It stopped raining!</b>

16:05.880 --> 16:09.210
<b>I work at a café called Crossroads
right down there.</b>

16:09.290 --> 16:11.460
<b>If you drop by,
I'll pay you back for this.</b>

16:12.580 --> 16:14.040
<b>Make sure you come, okay?</b>

16:56.000 --> 16:57.000
<b>All right.</b>

16:57.630 --> 17:00.630
<b>You're late.
I'm going to deduct it from your pay.</b>

17:00.710 --> 17:01.790
<b>You're so stingy!</b>

17:02.380 --> 17:04.170
<b>Take this water to table four.</b>

17:04.250 --> 17:06.920
<b>Stingy! Stingy! Stingy! Stingy! Stingy!</b>

17:11.630 --> 17:13.290
<b>That was fast!</b>

17:13.380 --> 17:16.830
<b>Huh? You got here faster than me!</b>

17:16.920 --> 17:18.920
<b>Well, I guess you're right.</b>

17:20.420 --> 17:22.540
<b>I just came so that you could pay me back.</b>

17:28.710 --> 17:30.790
<b>Let's have a drink together!</b>

17:30.880 --> 17:34.420
<b>Hey! Can you bring some coffee
for me and him?</b>

17:35.210 --> 17:37.040
<b>But you work here.</b>

17:37.130 --> 17:39.040
<b>What's the big deal?</b>

17:39.130 --> 17:41.880
<b>We only get customers
in the morning anyway.</b>

17:44.130 --> 17:45.380
<b>Well...</b>

17:46.830 --> 17:48.830
<b>A cup of coffee is my gift back to you!</b>

17:49.750 --> 17:50.830
<b>Do you like coffee?</b>

17:51.500 --> 17:52.630
<b>I'll drink it.</b>

17:58.130 --> 18:01.170
<b>What's with that face?
You're just pretending you're fine!</b>

18:01.250 --> 18:03.330
<b>Coffee tastes bad!</b>

18:03.420 --> 18:05.330
<b>It tastes like it's from the gutter!</b>

18:08.500 --> 18:10.250
<b>You're just like a little kid!</b>

18:12.380 --> 18:15.960
<b><i>She's touching me a lot,</i>
<i>and she's laughing at my jokes.</i></b>

18:16.460 --> 18:17.750
<b><i>Could it be that...</i></b>

18:18.540 --> 18:20.130
<b><i>she likes me?</i></b>

18:21.790 --> 18:23.330
<b>My name's Reze.</b>

18:23.830 --> 18:24.920
<b>What's your name?</b>

18:25.920 --> 18:26.960
<b>Denji.</b>

18:27.920 --> 18:28.920
<b>Denji?</b>

18:29.750 --> 18:31.130
<b>Denji...</b>

18:35.290 --> 18:38.580
<b>Denji, I've never met someone
as interesting as you.</b>

18:42.460 --> 18:44.750
<b><i>I'm sure about it now. She does like me.</i></b>

18:46.210 --> 18:47.670
<b><i>What am I going to do?</i></b>

18:48.290 --> 18:50.880
<b><i>I like people who like me too.</i></b>

18:52.080 --> 18:54.170
<b><i>Makima... help.</i></b>

18:55.250 --> 18:58.250
<b><i>I'm going to start falling for this girl.</i></b>

19:14.420 --> 19:16.960
<b>You've had three already. That's enough.</b>

19:17.040 --> 19:18.460
<b>We're going to go on patrol now.</b>

19:20.330 --> 19:22.790
<b>Eating ice cream made me tired.</b>

19:22.880 --> 19:25.330
<b>I heard that eating takes energy too.</b>

19:30.750 --> 19:33.210
<b>I don't want to work anymore today.</b>

19:34.080 --> 19:37.210
<b>They found out where the Gun Devil is.
There's going to be an expedition.</b>

19:37.290 --> 19:42.080
<b>In order to participate, I need to have
more experience defeating big devils.</b>

19:42.790 --> 19:46.210
<b>That's why I want to
go look for more devils.</b>

19:46.290 --> 19:49.380
<b>You're my buddy. Please help me out.</b>

19:59.330 --> 20:02.080
<b>How about I think about it a bit
after I've had another ice cream?</b>

20:03.630 --> 20:04.630
<b>Get up.</b>

20:05.130 --> 20:07.710
<b>If I tell the leadership
that you're useless,</b>

20:07.790 --> 20:10.920
<b>they're going to kill you as a devil.
Are you sure you're okay with that?</b>

20:18.670 --> 20:21.580
<b>I'd rather die than work.</b>

20:24.920 --> 20:28.710
<b><i>He's the second-most powerful member</i>
<i>of Division 4, after Captain Kishibe.</i></b>

20:30.080 --> 20:32.790
<b>At least he would be
if he weren't always so lazy.</b>

20:33.630 --> 20:36.830
<b>If you want to join the expedition
to defeat the Gun Devil,</b>

20:36.920 --> 20:39.670
<b>then you should try
to make good use of him.</b>

20:40.960 --> 20:43.540
<b>I don't think
I can get along well with a devil.</b>

20:44.170 --> 20:47.040
<b>But you get along with Power, right?</b>

20:47.540 --> 20:50.580
<b>We had a fistfight just this morning.</b>

20:52.540 --> 20:55.290
<b>You don't have to become friends.</b>

20:56.040 --> 20:58.960
<b>Just use him for your own benefit.</b>

20:59.540 --> 21:01.830
<b>He's someone
who killed every single person</b>

21:01.920 --> 21:04.170
<b>in the village where he was born.</b>

21:04.250 --> 21:05.710
<b>Or to put it more accurately:</b>

21:06.420 --> 21:09.460
<b>He sucked the lifespans out of them
and transformed them into weapons.</b>

21:10.210 --> 21:11.210
<b>Weapons?</b>

21:11.790 --> 21:15.580
<b>He has the power to transform the life
of anyone he touches into a weapon.</b>

21:15.670 --> 21:19.500
<b>That katana you have
is one of his weapons too.</b>

21:19.580 --> 21:23.080
<b>Those weapons can do things like cut
through ghosts that no one can touch...</b>

21:23.170 --> 21:25.500
<b>and have different special powers.</b>

21:27.330 --> 21:30.420
<b>It's okay if you have to pretend.
Just be friendly with him.</b>

21:30.500 --> 21:33.000
<b>I'm sure he'll be useful to you.</b>

21:54.330 --> 21:55.920
<b>I've eliminated the devil!</b>

21:56.420 --> 21:59.960
<b>Please make sure
not to touch its blood or its flesh!</b>

22:06.710 --> 22:08.920
<b>Whoa, that looks delicious.</b>

22:11.040 --> 22:12.670
<b>Hey you, human.</b>

22:12.750 --> 22:14.250
<b>Come over here.</b>

22:15.420 --> 22:18.380
<b>He must be a private Devil Hunter.</b>

22:18.460 --> 22:20.920
<b>He was being eaten up by this devil.</b>

22:21.000 --> 22:24.170
<b>The lower half of his body
is gone already. He's almost dead.</b>

22:29.830 --> 22:32.920
<b>Kill me. Kill me.</b>

22:33.540 --> 22:36.330
<b>Your power gives you
the ability to kill him painlessly.</b>

22:36.420 --> 22:37.830
<b>Grant him his wish to die.</b>

22:38.330 --> 22:39.710
<b>No way.</b>

22:40.380 --> 22:42.710
<b>I may be an angel, but I'm also a devil.</b>

22:43.420 --> 22:46.170
<b>I believe that humans
should suffer when they die.</b>

23:05.290 --> 23:07.830
<b>I don't think we can become friends.
Even if I pretend.</b>

23:09.080 --> 23:10.080
<b>I guess not.</b>

23:13.710 --> 23:16.960
<b><i>Makima's the one who found my heart.</i></b>

23:17.540 --> 23:21.380
<b><i>So that's why my heart belongs to Makima.</i></b>

23:22.880 --> 23:25.380
<b><i>But... my body...</i></b>

23:25.460 --> 23:26.960
<b><i>It's moving on its own!</i></b>

23:29.130 --> 23:31.250
<b>Oh, it's you!</b>

23:31.330 --> 23:32.880
<b>I came to have lunch.</b>

23:33.960 --> 23:37.960
<b>The food here's not that good. No one
would come every day for a whole week.</b>

23:38.580 --> 23:39.880
<b>It's good.</b>

23:39.960 --> 23:41.500
<b>It is good.</b>

23:41.580 --> 23:43.460
<b>You have such bad taste.</b>

23:44.580 --> 23:45.960
<b>Well...</b>

23:46.500 --> 23:49.420
<b>I'll have some curry and some ice cream.</b>

23:49.500 --> 23:50.750
<b>And some fried rice!</b>

23:50.830 --> 23:54.670
<b>How about you come eat
over here at this table?</b>

23:54.750 --> 23:55.750
<b>I'm fine here.</b>

23:55.830 --> 23:59.040
<b>You're studying right now, right?
Even though you're on the clock.</b>

23:59.130 --> 24:01.830
<b>You don't go to school, right?</b>

24:01.920 --> 24:03.790
<b>Even though you're 16.</b>

24:06.630 --> 24:10.250
<b>I think that's even worse.</b>

24:10.330 --> 24:12.210
<b>Do you really think so?</b>

24:12.290 --> 24:13.540
<b>I see.</b>

24:13.630 --> 24:16.540
<b>You're working as a Devil Hunter
instead of going to school.</b>

24:16.630 --> 24:18.920
<b>You're a weird one.</b>

24:24.460 --> 24:27.380
<b>I'm going to study over here.</b>

24:27.460 --> 24:28.920
<b>Scoot over! Scoot over!</b>

24:33.130 --> 24:35.460
<b>I want to learn how to read kanji.</b>

24:35.540 --> 24:37.170
<b>You can't read kanji?</b>

24:37.750 --> 24:39.380
<b>Then I'll teach you!</b>

24:40.460 --> 24:41.710
<b>Here's a question.</b>

24:42.290 --> 24:43.330
<b>Ta-da!</b>

24:43.420 --> 24:45.290
<b>What does this say?</b>

24:45.380 --> 24:47.830
<b>That says "balls," you sex-crazed girl.</b>

24:47.920 --> 24:50.210
<b>So you do know what it says.</b>

24:50.790 --> 24:53.460
<b>"Balls" is the only one I can read.</b>

24:57.420 --> 24:58.880
<b>That's crazy.</b>

25:04.420 --> 25:07.540
<b>I wish I could have
gone to school with you.</b>

25:07.630 --> 25:09.170
<b>It would have been fun.</b>

25:14.920 --> 25:16.750
<b><i>What am I saying?</i></b>

25:21.040 --> 25:22.750
<b>Do you want to go with me?</b>

25:22.830 --> 25:24.750
<b>-At night.
-At night?</b>

25:25.380 --> 25:28.880
<b>Let's go explore
a school building together at night.</b>

25:32.960 --> 25:33.960
<b>Okay.</b>

25:34.960 --> 25:37.130
<b><i>My heart belongs to Makima,</i></b>

25:38.170 --> 25:41.080
<b><i>but my body won't listen to me!</i></b>

25:52.080 --> 25:53.380
<b>Typhoon.</b>

25:54.080 --> 25:55.080
<b>What is it?</b>

25:55.710 --> 26:00.290
<b>Why do you devils want Chainsaw's heart?</b>

26:01.960 --> 26:03.540
<b>You don't need to know.</b>

26:03.630 --> 26:06.040
<b>The only thing you need to focus on
is holding up your end of the contract</b>

26:06.130 --> 26:07.330
<b>between you and me.</b>

26:08.330 --> 26:11.130
<b>Sounds like we're going to be
working together for a while.</b>

26:11.210 --> 26:13.420
<b>So let's get more comfortable
with each other.</b>

26:14.830 --> 26:17.380
<b>Typhoon Devil.</b>

26:20.580 --> 26:25.540
<b>The contract is that once
I get my hands on Chainsaw's heart,</b>

26:25.630 --> 26:27.750
<b>you'll let me use your powers forever.</b>

26:28.250 --> 26:29.420
<b>Be careful.</b>

26:29.500 --> 26:34.380
<b>The human who has Chainsaw's heart
has killed lots of devils.</b>

26:34.960 --> 26:38.380
<b>That's because
the devils aren't very bright.</b>

26:41.710 --> 26:46.420
<b>I killed a Devil Hunter from China
for a job once.</b>

26:46.500 --> 26:51.670
<b>He was a merciless Devil Hunter.
They said he had no blood or tears.</b>

26:52.540 --> 26:54.380
<b>How did you kill him?</b>

27:01.790 --> 27:04.790
<b>I looked for how I could
make him bleed and cry.</b>

27:05.290 --> 27:08.130
<b>I took his wife and kid as hostages.</b>

27:08.210 --> 27:11.170
<b>Then I skinned them
and showed him their hides.</b>

27:11.250 --> 27:13.250
<b>He let me kill him after that.</b>

27:28.080 --> 27:29.500
<b>Denji, aren't you scared?</b>

27:30.540 --> 27:34.250
<b>I'm not really scared.</b>

27:34.330 --> 27:35.830
<b>This just feels weird.</b>

27:37.420 --> 27:38.960
<b>What do you mean?</b>

27:44.960 --> 27:47.250
<b>Hey. I'm a little scared.</b>

27:48.000 --> 27:49.540
<b>Can I hold your hand?</b>

27:59.580 --> 28:01.130
<b><i>Makima.</i></b>

28:01.210 --> 28:03.920
<b><i>To be honest,</i>
<i>I don't want to hold her hand.</i></b>

28:05.710 --> 28:08.500
<b><i>But my body just...</i></b>

28:13.210 --> 28:15.750
<b>Who knows the answer?</b>

28:15.830 --> 28:17.330
<b>Me! Me! Me!</b>

28:17.420 --> 28:18.710
<b>Two! It's two!</b>

28:18.790 --> 28:20.330
<b>That's right! You're a genius!</b>

28:21.630 --> 28:25.380
<b>-What does this English word mean?
-I have no idea!</b>

28:25.460 --> 28:27.880
<b>The answer is: "Big ass."</b>

28:27.960 --> 28:29.380
<b>You sex-crazed girl!</b>

28:31.630 --> 28:33.580
<b>So this is what school is like.</b>

28:33.670 --> 28:35.250
<b>I think I've got the hang of it now.</b>

28:36.880 --> 28:40.250
<b>Denji, is it really true that
you didn't even go to elementary school?</b>

28:40.330 --> 28:41.790
<b>Yeah.</b>

28:42.420 --> 28:46.880
<b>Isn't that... bad?</b>

28:46.960 --> 28:48.380
<b>Bad?</b>

28:49.250 --> 28:50.670
<b>Well, not bad.</b>

28:51.380 --> 28:52.540
<b>It's weird.</b>

28:54.630 --> 28:57.420
<b>A 16-year-old is still a kid.</b>

28:57.920 --> 29:00.170
<b>Normally, you'd study for entrance exams,</b>

29:00.250 --> 29:03.790
<b>join school clubs,
and go out with friends.</b>

29:04.420 --> 29:08.710
<b>But you... you kill devils
and almost get yourself killed by them.</b>

29:09.250 --> 29:11.580
<b>Public Safety,
that place you work at now,</b>

29:11.670 --> 29:13.210
<b>is it really a good place?</b>

29:14.920 --> 29:17.670
<b>Well, it's a really good place, you know.</b>

29:18.380 --> 29:20.170
<b>I get to eat three meals a day.</b>

29:20.250 --> 29:21.880
<b>And I get to sleep on a futon.</b>

29:23.710 --> 29:27.040
<b>But that's the bare minimum
for everyone in Japan.</b>

29:27.540 --> 29:29.500
<b>It's something that's normal for everyone.</b>

29:33.500 --> 29:36.290
<b>My head's getting hot
from thinking too hard.</b>

29:38.920 --> 29:39.920
<b>In that case...</b>

29:41.460 --> 29:43.330
<b>Do you want to cool down a bit?</b>

29:55.170 --> 29:56.750
<b>It's so cold!</b>

30:04.670 --> 30:07.170
<b>I don't know how to swim that well,
you know.</b>

30:16.750 --> 30:19.210
<b>Then I'll teach you how to swim.</b>

30:30.330 --> 30:33.750
<b>Take off your clothes.
Your clothes are going to pull you down.</b>

30:33.830 --> 30:35.750
<b>You're so sexy.</b>

30:35.830 --> 30:38.380
<b>Don't you want to learn how to swim?</b>

30:40.170 --> 30:41.920
<b>I am starting to want to learn.</b>

30:47.330 --> 30:49.500
<b>Denji, you should get naked too.</b>

30:50.830 --> 30:53.330
<b>It's dark. I can't see anyway.</b>

30:54.580 --> 30:56.540
<b>-<i>Calm down!</i>
-<i>I can see everything!</i></b>

30:56.630 --> 30:57.830
<b><i>It's my first time seeing nipples!</i></b>

30:57.920 --> 31:00.580
<b><i>If I take off my clothes now,</i>
<i>I'll be betraying Makima!</i></b>

31:05.960 --> 31:07.130
<b><i>Damn!</i></b>

31:13.130 --> 31:16.380
<b>Come on! Come over here, Denji!</b>

31:17.380 --> 31:21.540
<b><i>No, Denji.</i>
<i>If I go, then my heart will go too.</i></b>

31:22.540 --> 31:23.790
<b>I know what's going on.</b>

31:23.880 --> 31:26.920
<b>You're scared to get in the pool
because you can't swim.</b>

31:30.000 --> 31:31.420
<b>Come on!</b>

31:31.500 --> 31:32.710
<b>It feels good!</b>

31:34.040 --> 31:35.460
<b>Hurry up! Come on!</b>

32:55.330 --> 32:56.500
<b>I'll teach you.</b>

32:57.960 --> 33:00.330
<b>I'll teach you things you don't know.</b>

33:00.460 --> 33:01.920
<b>Things you don't know how to do.</b>

33:02.960 --> 33:06.130
<b>I'll teach you everything.</b>

33:12.420 --> 33:14.670
<b>Denji! Breathe! Breathe!</b>

33:28.880 --> 33:30.250
<b>It's raining!</b>

33:30.330 --> 33:31.380
<b>Yeah!</b>

33:54.790 --> 33:56.670
<b>The rain's not stopping.</b>

34:04.710 --> 34:06.250
<b>Denji...</b>

34:06.920 --> 34:09.960
<b>The country mouse or the city mouse.</b>

34:10.540 --> 34:12.080
<b>Which one would you rather be?</b>

34:13.040 --> 34:14.330
<b>What are you talking about?</b>

34:15.540 --> 34:17.500
<b>It's one of Aesop's fables.</b>

34:20.420 --> 34:23.290
<b>The country mouse lives a safe life,</b>

34:23.380 --> 34:25.750
<b>but doesn't have delicious food
like the city mouse.</b>

34:26.670 --> 34:29.880
<b>The city mouse can find good food,</b>

34:29.960 --> 34:32.630
<b>but he's in danger of getting killed
by a cat or a human.</b>

34:37.080 --> 34:39.540
<b>I wanted to be the country mouse.</b>

34:40.710 --> 34:45.540
<b>But Makima captured me
and brought me to the city.</b>

34:50.210 --> 34:52.460
<b>My heart belongs in the countryside.</b>

34:53.040 --> 34:56.380
<b>I don't want to follow around a city mouse
like you and put myself in danger.</b>

34:58.250 --> 34:59.250
<b>Hey...</b>

35:03.540 --> 35:06.130
<b>I want to be the city mouse.</b>

35:06.210 --> 35:07.330
<b>What?</b>

35:07.420 --> 35:09.960
<b>Being the country mouse is better!</b>

35:10.080 --> 35:12.210
<b>A peaceful life is what's best.</b>

35:12.290 --> 35:14.330
<b>The city has more good food.</b>

35:14.420 --> 35:15.630
<b>And it looks fun.</b>

35:16.790 --> 35:19.830
<b>Are you saying you just
want to eat and have fun?</b>

35:19.920 --> 35:21.210
<b>Yeah.</b>

35:24.630 --> 35:28.170
<b>In that case, there's a festival
going on nearby tomorrow.</b>

35:28.250 --> 35:31.710
<b>Do you want to go together?
I'm sure it'll be fun. And delicious.</b>

35:34.000 --> 35:36.330
<b>I can go if it's after work.</b>

35:36.420 --> 35:39.880
<b>Yay! It's a promise, okay?</b>

35:42.420 --> 35:45.040
<b>I'm going to the restroom.</b>

35:51.420 --> 35:53.080
<b>She's so damn cute.</b>

37:01.630 --> 37:02.830
<b>Denji?</b>

37:07.710 --> 37:11.170
<b>That's right. I'm Denji.</b>

37:12.420 --> 37:16.710
<b>I was just about to go pee myself.</b>

37:21.130 --> 37:23.460
<b>Let's go to the bathroom together.</b>

37:24.250 --> 37:25.580
<b>Okay?</b>

37:35.630 --> 37:36.630
<b>Pochita.</b>

37:37.210 --> 37:39.380
<b>I have feelings
for two different people now.</b>

37:41.000 --> 37:42.460
<b>Do you know who I'm talking about?</b>

37:43.830 --> 37:45.540
<b><i>I'm not talking about that angel.</i></b>

37:46.170 --> 37:47.830
<b><i>He's a guy.</i></b>

37:54.330 --> 37:57.250
<b><i>The small girl has a pretty face,</i></b>

37:57.330 --> 37:59.580
<b><i>but she tried to kill me.</i></b>

38:01.960 --> 38:03.630
<b>Come on!</b>

38:04.290 --> 38:07.630
<b><i>Power still tries to</i>
<i>kill me sometimes too.</i></b>

38:07.710 --> 38:09.330
<b><i>She's a narcissist, she's selfish,</i></b>

38:09.420 --> 38:12.170
<b><i>she's a pathological liar,</i>
<i>and she's a bigot.</i></b>

38:13.880 --> 38:15.880
<b>How come you're running away?</b>

38:15.960 --> 38:18.750
<b>You promised you'd go
to the bathroom with me!</b>

38:23.830 --> 38:25.330
<b><i>What am I going to do?</i></b>

38:26.960 --> 38:29.830
<b><i>When I close my eyes, there's two of them!</i></b>

38:32.210 --> 38:34.040
<b><i>Pochita. Which one would you choose?</i></b>

38:57.790 --> 38:59.210
<b>Hello!</b>

39:00.330 --> 39:02.960
<b>Are you going to pee on the roof?</b>

39:03.460 --> 39:05.880
<b>Who... Who are you?</b>

39:09.080 --> 39:10.710
<b>You're asking me,</b>

39:10.790 --> 39:13.460
<b>but do you have any idea who you are?</b>

39:14.380 --> 39:16.670
<b>I know who you are.</b>

39:16.790 --> 39:18.790
<b>You're a piece of cheese.</b>

39:19.380 --> 39:22.500
<b>You're a piece of cheese
for luring out the mouse.</b>

39:22.960 --> 39:25.710
<b>What are you talking about? Please stop!</b>

39:27.170 --> 39:30.670
<b>I'm going to skin your face,
carve out your eyes</b>

39:30.750 --> 39:32.460
<b>and show it all to Chainsaw!</b>

39:32.540 --> 39:34.420
<b>And this is what I'm going to tell him.</b>

39:35.420 --> 39:39.630
<b>"Your precious woman is still alive."</b>

39:42.920 --> 39:44.500
<b>And whenever I do that,</b>

39:44.580 --> 39:47.920
<b>everyone starts listening to me
for some reason.</b>

39:48.000 --> 39:49.960
<b>Then all that's left
for me to do is to kill him.</b>

39:50.040 --> 39:54.080
<b>The only piece of your body I want
is your skin and your eyeballs!</b>

39:55.210 --> 39:58.250
<b>I don't need to take your life!</b>

40:37.500 --> 40:41.080
<b><i>I have a date with Jane today</i></b>

40:41.170 --> 40:43.040
<b><i>All is ready</i></b>

40:43.130 --> 40:48.170
<b><i>In the morning</i>
<i>We'll go to church together</i></b>

40:48.880 --> 40:52.670
<b><i>We will drink coffee</i></b>

40:54.210 --> 40:58.210
<b><i>And eat omelets at a café</i></b>

40:59.670 --> 41:03.330
<b><i>After a walk</i></b>

41:03.420 --> 41:08.080
<b><i>In a park</i></b>

41:09.080 --> 41:12.880
<b><i>We will go to an aquarium</i></b>

41:14.580 --> 41:18.380
<b><i>And we will see dolphins and penguins</i></b>

41:19.920 --> 41:24.790
<b><i>Loved by Jane</i></b>

41:25.290 --> 41:28.710
<b><i>We will rest after lunch</i></b>

41:28.790 --> 41:34.130
<b><i>So, what did we do in the morning?</i></b>

41:34.830 --> 41:38.790
<b><i>We will speak about it</i></b>

41:40.210 --> 41:44.040
<b><i>Until we remember</i></b>

41:45.500 --> 41:49.500
<b><i>We won't remember</i></b>

41:50.540 --> 41:55.580
<b><i>And we will sleep</i>
<i>At the church that night</i></b>

42:24.920 --> 42:27.630
<b>You're the one who made the storm
to trap us inside the building.</b>

42:28.210 --> 42:29.210
<b>Right, Typhoon?</b>

42:30.080 --> 42:32.750
<b>I didn't know you were here, Lady Reze.</b>

42:33.500 --> 42:35.830
<b>I'll turn a blind eye
to what you did today.</b>

42:35.920 --> 42:38.420
<b>In exchange, you'll obey me for a while.</b>

42:38.500 --> 42:41.250
<b>Go deal with his body.</b>

43:14.790 --> 43:16.000
<b>Boo!</b>

44:48.130 --> 44:52.080
<b>I heard about this place
from the owner of the café I work at.</b>

44:52.170 --> 44:54.250
<b>He said it's the best spot
to watch fireworks.</b>

44:54.330 --> 44:57.080
<b>No one else ever comes here.
It's a secret spot.</b>

45:14.080 --> 45:15.330
<b>Hey, Denji.</b>

45:16.040 --> 45:18.080
<b>I've been thinking a lot these days.</b>

45:19.080 --> 45:22.330
<b>I think your current situation is weird.</b>

45:22.420 --> 45:25.330
<b>You're only 16,
but they're not letting you go to school.</b>

45:25.420 --> 45:27.330
<b>And they're making you kill devils.</b>

45:27.920 --> 45:29.960
<b>It's not something
this country should allow.</b>

45:36.580 --> 45:39.500
<b>Why don't you quit your job
and run away with me?</b>

45:40.040 --> 45:42.960
<b>I'll make you happy.</b>

45:43.790 --> 45:45.580
<b>I'll protect you
for the rest of your life.</b>

45:46.960 --> 45:48.130
<b>Please.</b>

45:53.670 --> 45:56.380
<b>Run away? Where?</b>

45:57.210 --> 45:59.000
<b>I'll ask my friend.</b>

45:59.080 --> 46:02.460
<b>My friend has a place
where Public Safety will never find you.</b>

46:02.540 --> 46:04.460
<b>It won't happen right away,</b>

46:04.540 --> 46:06.540
<b>but we can go to school
together there someday.</b>

46:07.750 --> 46:09.540
<b>Why would you do all that for me?</b>

46:10.960 --> 46:12.630
<b>Because...</b>

46:13.460 --> 46:15.330
<b>I like you, Denji.</b>

46:25.330 --> 46:27.630
<b>Why are you having
such a hard time deciding?</b>

46:28.580 --> 46:30.250
<b>Denji, do you hate me?</b>

46:30.830 --> 46:32.130
<b>I like you!</b>

46:33.500 --> 46:34.500
<b>But...</b>

46:35.080 --> 46:38.080
<b>I've just recently started
to feel appreciated at work.</b>

46:38.750 --> 46:41.500
<b>I can go farther away without supervision.</b>

46:42.500 --> 46:46.380
<b>I'm gradually learning how to deal with
my buddy, who has a shitty personality.</b>

46:47.830 --> 46:51.580
<b>And I've finally started to become friends
with my difficult senior colleague.</b>

46:52.710 --> 46:55.170
<b>And I've found a goal
to work towards at work.</b>

46:55.960 --> 46:58.420
<b>Things are starting to get fun now.</b>

46:59.750 --> 47:03.790
<b>Can't I keep seeing you
while I continue to work?</b>

47:06.960 --> 47:09.540
<b>-The fireworks are about to begin!
-This way, please!</b>

47:12.420 --> 47:13.540
<b>I see.</b>

47:14.210 --> 47:15.250
<b>I understand.</b>

47:17.790 --> 47:18.790
<b>Denji.</b>

47:19.630 --> 47:23.380
<b>There's someone else you like, right?</b>

48:46.290 --> 48:47.460
<b>It hurts, doesn't it?</b>

48:47.960 --> 48:49.460
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

48:57.420 --> 49:00.830
<b>Denji, I'm going to take your heart. Okay?</b>

49:07.330 --> 49:09.420
<b>Dash!</b>

49:18.330 --> 49:21.000
<b>Run away! We're in trouble!</b>

49:21.080 --> 49:24.130
<b>How come I didn't notice anything
from the smell?</b>

49:24.210 --> 49:26.630
<b>She's dangerous, Lord Chainsaw!</b>

49:26.710 --> 49:29.540
<b>That smell...</b>

49:30.210 --> 49:33.920
<b>She's the Bomb Devil!</b>

49:37.960 --> 49:39.330
<b>Boom.</b>

50:05.210 --> 50:06.210
<b>You thief.</b>

50:34.250 --> 50:35.540
<b>Lord Chainsaw!</b>

50:49.670 --> 50:52.330
<b>Are you from Division 4 too?</b>

50:52.420 --> 50:55.250
<b>I'll let you go if you leave Denji there
and leave right now.</b>

51:03.080 --> 51:04.790
<b>Oh. I see.</b>

51:34.540 --> 51:38.000
<b>Damn. I wanted to go to the festival.</b>

51:38.500 --> 51:40.670
<b>Whoa. She's killing something.</b>

51:40.750 --> 51:43.210
<b>We've encountered a devil
near the festival.</b>

51:44.170 --> 51:46.210
<b>2,034.</b>

51:46.920 --> 51:48.670
<b>The battle begins.</b>

51:49.330 --> 51:51.750
<b>Are you private Devil Hunters?</b>

51:51.830 --> 51:53.830
<b>Whoa. She said something.</b>

51:53.920 --> 51:55.920
<b>This one's really strong.</b>

52:16.920 --> 52:18.420
<b>They sure ran away fast!</b>

52:19.580 --> 52:21.500
<b>Devil Extermination Division 2 Fuchū Training Facility</b>

52:33.580 --> 52:34.710
<b>Match over!</b>

52:35.330 --> 52:37.040
<b>Thank you.</b>

52:39.330 --> 52:42.040
<b>Thank you for your instruction.</b>

52:43.420 --> 52:44.750
<b>Aki.</b>

52:45.630 --> 52:48.380
<b>Thanks for coming.</b>

52:48.460 --> 52:50.460
<b>I can't say no to you, Nomo.</b>

52:50.540 --> 52:54.750
<b>Whoa! Really?
Then come back to Division 2!</b>

52:54.830 --> 52:58.380
<b>All the stories I hear about
the Special Division sound so gory anyway.</b>

52:58.460 --> 53:02.540
<b>If everything goes well, I'm going
to become the sub-captain in five years.</b>

53:02.630 --> 53:05.130
<b>When that happens,
I'm going to invite you to join.</b>

53:06.920 --> 53:08.380
<b>Thank you very much.</b>

53:11.630 --> 53:12.670
<b><i>Hey.</i></b>

53:13.290 --> 53:15.750
<b>You haven't told him
that you'll be dead in five years?</b>

53:16.920 --> 53:19.420
<b>Who did you hear that from?</b>

53:19.500 --> 53:20.920
<b>From Power.</b>

53:21.540 --> 53:22.960
<b>That damn devil.</b>

53:24.500 --> 53:26.040
<b>Don't tell anyone.</b>

53:27.750 --> 53:29.540
<b>You're so lucky.</b>

53:29.630 --> 53:31.710
<b>I want to die soon too.</b>

53:32.880 --> 53:35.580
<b>As long as I'm alive, I have to work hard.</b>

53:35.670 --> 53:37.750
<b>If I die,
I won't have to work hard anymore.</b>

53:39.250 --> 53:40.750
<b>Oh, that reminds me...</b>

53:41.330 --> 53:43.710
<b>You have a contract
with the Future Devil, right?</b>

53:44.210 --> 53:45.920
<b>Why don't you try asking it?</b>

53:46.000 --> 53:47.710
<b>Ask it when I'm going to die.</b>

53:48.960 --> 53:50.170
<b>I refuse.</b>

53:51.750 --> 53:54.580
<b>Aki! Come downstairs! Now!</b>

53:56.420 --> 53:59.290
<b>He showed up at the entrance and claimed
he's from the Special Division.</b>

54:00.290 --> 54:02.960
<b>Is this fiend really on our side?</b>

54:03.040 --> 54:04.460
<b>Yes.</b>

54:04.960 --> 54:08.210
<b>Did a devil do this to Denji?</b>

54:09.290 --> 54:12.080
<b>Bomb is coming... Bomb...</b>

54:12.750 --> 54:15.330
<b>She's one of the Gun Devil's allies!</b>

54:17.420 --> 54:19.710
<b>How do you know that?</b>

54:22.130 --> 54:23.210
<b>Answer me.</b>

54:23.830 --> 54:26.460
<b>I could kill you right here
if I wanted to.</b>

54:27.540 --> 54:29.580
<b>If I tell you, they'll kill me.</b>

54:29.670 --> 54:31.460
<b>I promised Makima.</b>

54:31.540 --> 54:32.960
<b>Makima?</b>

54:34.540 --> 54:36.750
<b>There she is! Bomb's here!</b>

54:44.540 --> 54:45.920
<b>Hey, beautiful lady!</b>

54:46.540 --> 54:48.540
<b>Don't come any closer!</b>

54:49.040 --> 54:51.750
<b>This place is a training facility
for Devil Extermination Division 2.</b>

54:51.830 --> 54:54.580
<b>Members of the public
are not allowed to enter.</b>

54:56.380 --> 54:58.750
<b>Excuse me!</b>

55:00.290 --> 55:01.330
<b>Reze...</b>

55:01.420 --> 55:02.710
<b>Reze?</b>

55:02.790 --> 55:05.250
<b>Please help me!</b>

55:05.330 --> 55:07.960
<b>I'm being attacked by a devil!</b>

55:09.580 --> 55:12.290
<b>She's sure smiling a lot
for someone under attack.</b>

55:12.380 --> 55:14.250
<b>-Nomo.
-Yeah.</b>

55:14.330 --> 55:16.460
<b>Take your friend with you
and stay in the back.</b>

55:16.540 --> 55:17.750
<b>Okay.</b>

55:17.830 --> 55:21.670
<b>Contact headquarters and the vice-captain.
Summon all Division 2 members.</b>

55:21.750 --> 55:23.210
<b>Okay!</b>

55:23.290 --> 55:24.380
<b>And...</b>

55:25.040 --> 55:27.750
<b>Have you seen that beauty
somewhere before?</b>

55:28.330 --> 55:30.750
<b>Now's not the right time
to try to pick up women.</b>

55:30.830 --> 55:33.250
<b>No, I'm being serious.</b>

55:36.540 --> 55:39.630
<b>It can't be true. There's no way.</b>

55:39.710 --> 55:42.380
<b>Thanks. I'm counting on you.</b>

55:42.460 --> 55:43.750
<b>You owe me one.</b>

55:45.670 --> 55:47.250
<b>Kato! Tanabe!</b>

55:48.130 --> 55:50.710
<b>I'll treat you to dinner
if you can kill that woman.</b>

55:50.790 --> 55:53.750
<b>Don't assume she's a human.
Handle her like you would a devil.</b>

55:54.380 --> 55:57.130
<b>I guess it didn't work.</b>

55:57.210 --> 55:58.670
<b>It's not working.</b>

55:59.960 --> 56:01.670
<b>In that case, I've got no choice.</b>

56:03.790 --> 56:06.040
<b>I'll just have to kill everyone.</b>

56:12.380 --> 56:13.540
<b>Blood?</b>

56:13.630 --> 56:16.210
<b>We've caused mold to grow
in her heart and intestines.</b>

56:16.710 --> 56:19.290
<b>She's throwing up blood. It's working.</b>

56:19.380 --> 56:22.290
<b>Even if she drinks blood and regenerates,
the mold's not going to disappear.</b>

56:23.210 --> 56:25.290
<b>Now we just need to buy some time.</b>

56:32.630 --> 56:33.920
<b>She inflicted damage to herself!</b>

56:36.920 --> 56:38.630
<b>Are you able to grow mold on her brain?</b>

56:38.710 --> 56:40.880
<b>We can only do it if the target's alive.</b>

56:50.540 --> 56:51.580
<b>Boo.</b>

56:59.460 --> 57:01.880
<b>She's a devil! A devil is here!</b>

57:01.960 --> 57:04.710
<b>She went right!
Don't let her get near Aki!</b>

57:04.790 --> 57:06.420
<b>Nomo! Behind you!</b>

57:27.790 --> 57:30.540
<b>There she is! There's the devil!</b>

57:33.960 --> 57:36.540
<b>Masaki Ando,
requesting permission to fire!</b>

57:36.630 --> 57:37.830
<b>Permission granted!</b>

57:49.380 --> 57:51.630
<b>In Japan,
do you need permission to fire a gun?</b>

57:52.960 --> 57:53.960
<b>Kon!</b>

57:59.960 --> 58:01.960
<b>You're pretty stubborn.</b>

58:03.080 --> 58:05.920
<b>Now that's a real sight for sore eyes.</b>

58:11.500 --> 58:12.750
<b>Kon.</b>

58:19.630 --> 58:21.540
<b>Excuse me for a moment.</b>

58:21.630 --> 58:23.290
<b>Vice-captain!</b>

58:23.380 --> 58:26.380
<b>That was close.</b>

58:28.170 --> 58:30.170
<b>What's that taste?</b>

58:31.130 --> 58:34.710
<b>I hate this taste. I'm going home now.</b>

58:39.380 --> 58:41.830
<b>I was supposed to go
to a singles mixer today.</b>

58:42.330 --> 58:45.130
<b>Take me with you next time.</b>

58:47.040 --> 58:50.420
<b>I'll drive. You have them
drink some of your blood.</b>

58:52.080 --> 58:53.670
<b>I guess I've got no choice.</b>

58:57.250 --> 58:59.670
<b>Aren't you going to start the car?</b>

59:00.500 --> 59:01.920
<b>Damn.</b>

59:02.500 --> 59:05.420
<b>It showed me a future
I didn't want to see.</b>

59:17.750 --> 59:19.420
<b>That monster.</b>

59:19.500 --> 59:23.170
<b>I killed them to show you
how powerful I am.</b>

59:23.250 --> 59:25.540
<b>I don't want to kill anyone if possible.</b>

59:26.920 --> 59:29.920
<b>Take Denji out of the car and leave.</b>

59:44.960 --> 59:48.710
<b>The gasoline is going to
make that car burn to a crisp.</b>

59:52.880 --> 59:55.250
<b>What a pain.</b>

59:56.790 --> 59:58.290
<b>Acho!</b>

01:00:02.880 --> 01:00:04.880
<b>I asked the Special Division for backup.</b>

01:00:04.960 --> 01:00:06.170
<b>They saved us.</b>

01:00:12.790 --> 01:00:14.170
<b>No way!</b>

01:00:15.710 --> 01:00:18.670
<b>I kicked with everything I got just now.</b>

01:00:19.630 --> 01:00:21.210
<b>Nice kick.</b>

01:00:24.790 --> 01:00:26.040
<b>Want to fight?</b>

01:00:27.580 --> 01:00:30.670
<b>Kobeni! We're changing strategies!</b>

01:00:32.000 --> 01:00:35.130
<b>This one's a lot stronger than us!</b>

01:00:35.210 --> 01:00:37.420
<b>Time for a strategic retreat!</b>

01:00:38.000 --> 01:00:39.460
<b>Anyways, bye.</b>

01:00:44.710 --> 01:00:47.290
<b>My legs... My legs...</b>

01:00:47.380 --> 01:00:49.170
<b>My legs gave out...</b>

01:00:50.380 --> 01:00:53.170
<b>My legs... My legs...</b>

01:00:58.250 --> 01:01:01.170
<b>I'm sorry!</b>

01:01:01.250 --> 01:01:03.960
<b>I'll quit my job. So please forgive me!</b>

01:01:24.540 --> 01:01:25.540
<b>There she is!</b>

01:01:33.290 --> 01:01:36.960
<b>Hey. Chainsaw's awake now.</b>

01:01:37.040 --> 01:01:39.500
<b>But the bomb girl's right behind us.</b>

01:01:41.040 --> 01:01:43.080
<b>Shit! Damn!</b>

01:01:43.170 --> 01:01:45.460
<b>The transmitter's broken on this car.</b>

01:01:47.500 --> 01:01:49.170
<b>What's wrong with this car?</b>

01:01:50.290 --> 01:01:53.080
<b>If it comes down to it,
I'm going to crash this car into her!</b>

01:01:53.170 --> 01:01:55.830
<b>I can't let her have Denji!</b>

01:01:58.540 --> 01:02:01.290
<b>-What's going on?
-He's cutting the top of the car!</b>

01:02:05.630 --> 01:02:06.920
<b>Stop, Denji!</b>

01:02:07.000 --> 01:02:08.920
<b>You haven't had that much blood yet!</b>

01:02:10.130 --> 01:02:13.290
<b>It hurt so much,
I thought I was going to die.</b>

01:02:13.380 --> 01:02:16.380
<b>My brain's all mixed-up.</b>

01:02:16.460 --> 01:02:18.960
<b>But I spent some time
looking back on what's happened.</b>

01:02:20.330 --> 01:02:23.250
<b>And I just realized</b>

01:02:23.330 --> 01:02:26.830
<b>that every single girl I ever meet
always tries to kill me!</b>

01:02:27.420 --> 01:02:31.170
<b>Everyone always wants Chainsaw's heart!</b>

01:02:31.250 --> 01:02:34.500
<b>Doesn't anyone want Denji's heart?</b>

01:02:35.420 --> 01:02:39.080
<b>I really do like you, Denji. It's true.</b>

01:02:40.540 --> 01:02:41.580
<b>Really?</b>

01:02:43.670 --> 01:02:47.000
<b>Don't listen to the enemy!
You're so gullible!</b>

01:02:49.380 --> 01:02:52.830
<b>That was close.
I was about to get tricked.</b>

01:02:53.420 --> 01:02:56.670
<b>I don't know why you're trying to kill me.</b>

01:02:56.750 --> 01:02:58.880
<b>But I don't care!</b>

01:02:59.580 --> 01:03:01.630
<b>I've got Makima!</b>

01:03:02.460 --> 01:03:03.880
<b>Makima?</b>

01:03:03.960 --> 01:03:08.500
<b>Denji, I didn't know that witch
has got you in the palm of her hand.</b>

01:03:08.580 --> 01:03:11.630
<b>Then it would have been no use
even if we ran away together.</b>

01:03:13.380 --> 01:03:15.290
<b>I wish I never kissed you!</b>

01:03:19.830 --> 01:03:21.170
<b>If anyone else dies because of me,</b>

01:03:21.250 --> 01:03:24.080
<b>I'm going to have trouble getting
out of bed in the morning.</b>

01:03:25.210 --> 01:03:27.880
<b>I'm going to arrest you!</b>

01:03:27.960 --> 01:03:29.880
<b>Come here, Denji.</b>

01:03:29.960 --> 01:03:33.630
<b>I'm going to show you how we fight.</b>

01:03:33.710 --> 01:03:36.380
<b>Then show me!</b>

01:03:59.210 --> 01:04:02.330
<b>Denji. You're not applying
what you've learned.</b>

01:04:02.420 --> 01:04:05.170
<b>You can't just swing
your chainsaws around.</b>

01:04:05.250 --> 01:04:07.960
<b>You've got to understand
your own power better.</b>

01:04:12.710 --> 01:04:13.750
<b>Boom.</b>

01:05:07.750 --> 01:05:09.040
<b>Regeneration?</b>

01:05:10.080 --> 01:05:12.880
<b>So you were revving the engine
before you got kicked.</b>

01:05:48.290 --> 01:05:49.630
<b>You devil!</b>

01:06:09.750 --> 01:06:12.000
<b><i>If I mess up even a single move,</i>
<i>I'm going to die.</i></b>

01:06:12.670 --> 01:06:16.130
<b><i>I can see the future,</i>
<i>but only a few seconds in advance.</i></b>

01:06:16.710 --> 01:06:19.080
<b><i>I don't know if my body</i>
<i>will be able to react in time.</i></b>

01:06:25.080 --> 01:06:26.710
<b><i>Perfect judgment.</i></b>

01:06:31.960 --> 01:06:33.210
<b><i>Perfect judgment.</i></b>

01:06:35.250 --> 01:06:37.040
<b><i>Perfect judgment.</i></b>

01:06:42.830 --> 01:06:44.250
<b><i>Perfect—</i></b>

01:06:51.710 --> 01:06:52.920
<b>That was close!</b>

01:06:53.830 --> 01:06:55.920
<b>Sorry I'm late.</b>

01:06:56.500 --> 01:06:59.080
<b>This is the first time I've ever
wanted to be friends with a devil!</b>

01:06:59.170 --> 01:07:00.420
<b>Here you go.</b>

01:07:03.920 --> 01:07:06.130
<b>Time-out!</b>

01:07:06.210 --> 01:07:08.960
<b>I'm anemic and I'm almost naked over here.</b>

01:07:09.040 --> 01:07:11.210
<b>And you've got the two of you.
That's not fair.</b>

01:07:11.290 --> 01:07:14.710
<b>You're right. Should we give her a break?</b>

01:07:14.790 --> 01:07:16.080
<b>No.</b>

01:07:16.170 --> 01:07:18.210
<b>That's what he said. Sorry!</b>

01:07:18.290 --> 01:07:19.420
<b>The time-out is over.</b>

01:07:25.630 --> 01:07:29.830
<b>Lady Reze! Typhoon is here!</b>

01:07:31.000 --> 01:07:32.920
<b>That's not fair!</b>

01:07:51.960 --> 01:07:53.040
<b>It's okay.</b>

01:07:53.880 --> 01:07:55.790
<b>You're going to go to heaven.</b>

01:08:01.040 --> 01:08:02.830
<b>I'm going to take your blood.</b>

01:08:02.920 --> 01:08:04.080
<b>Sorry.</b>

01:08:25.250 --> 01:08:28.080
<b>A normal devil would have been dead.</b>

01:08:28.210 --> 01:08:31.250
<b>You're so impressive, Lord Chainsaw!
You're amazing!</b>

01:08:32.170 --> 01:08:35.130
<b>Your girlfriend has killed
too many people.</b>

01:08:35.210 --> 01:08:38.500
<b>If we let her run free,
then many more will die.</b>

01:08:39.460 --> 01:08:42.130
<b>Chainsaw. Make your choice.</b>

01:08:42.210 --> 01:08:46.130
<b><i>Either let her kill you</i>
<i>and minimize the damage,</i></b>

01:08:46.210 --> 01:08:47.960
<b><i>or kill her instead.</i></b>

01:08:50.080 --> 01:08:53.330
<b>Well, that's an easy decision.</b>

01:08:54.460 --> 01:08:56.920
<b>Reze is incredibly powerful, though.</b>

01:08:59.000 --> 01:09:02.420
<b>Shark, you know
about the Chainsaw Devil, right?</b>

01:09:03.000 --> 01:09:06.500
<b>If you don't want to die today,
then you should tell us what you know.</b>

01:09:08.500 --> 01:09:11.710
<b>Lord Chainsaw runs really fast!</b>

01:09:11.790 --> 01:09:16.540
<b>But when he goes places,
he doesn't just use his legs.</b>

01:09:16.630 --> 01:09:19.250
<b>He uses the chains on his chainsaws
to get around.</b>

01:09:19.330 --> 01:09:21.130
<b>He flings his chains through the air
and hooks them on buildings,</b>

01:09:21.210 --> 01:09:23.170
<b>and then he swings
from building to building!</b>

01:09:23.250 --> 01:09:27.460
<b>I see! Samurai Sword
draws his sword to get around.</b>

01:09:27.540 --> 01:09:30.210
<b>And Reze uses explosions.</b>

01:09:30.290 --> 01:09:32.580
<b>I need to apply my own powers too!</b>

01:09:32.670 --> 01:09:35.880
<b>Lord Chainsaw, you're a genius!</b>

01:09:35.960 --> 01:09:40.630
<b>I should use chains to get around!
I see! I get it!</b>

01:09:42.330 --> 01:09:45.130
<b>That's right!</b>

01:09:45.210 --> 01:09:47.000
<b>I'm going to try it!</b>

01:09:47.080 --> 01:09:49.920
<b>-Beam! Turn into a shark!
-Okay!</b>

01:09:54.500 --> 01:09:56.960
<b>This is it!</b>

01:09:58.250 --> 01:10:03.580
<b>I'm going to use chains to control Beam,
and Beam is going to run like a horse!</b>

01:10:05.210 --> 01:10:07.290
<b>That's not it...</b>

01:10:07.380 --> 01:10:10.420
<b>Are you sure? I don't think that's it.</b>

01:10:10.500 --> 01:10:13.380
<b>I think you're supposed to shoot out
the chains from your arms</b>

01:10:13.460 --> 01:10:15.040
<b>and hook them onto buildings.</b>

01:10:16.080 --> 01:10:18.790
<b>This is the right way! Right, Beam?</b>

01:10:18.880 --> 01:10:21.040
<b>You're right!</b>

01:10:21.130 --> 01:10:23.460
<b>All right! Run, Beam!</b>

01:10:23.540 --> 01:10:25.040
<b>You're right!</b>

01:10:36.960 --> 01:10:38.460
<b>What are you doing?</b>

01:10:39.330 --> 01:10:40.580
<b>Denji!</b>

01:10:41.210 --> 01:10:43.670
<b>There you are, Chainsaw!</b>

01:10:43.750 --> 01:10:47.290
<b>Denji! I'm going to make you
regret coming back to life!</b>

01:10:48.630 --> 01:10:52.830
<b>Beam! Don't make me regret this!</b>

01:10:52.920 --> 01:10:54.130
<b>Okay!</b>

01:10:56.330 --> 01:10:58.250
<b>Damn! Those guys...</b>

01:10:58.830 --> 01:11:00.250
<b>It's a monster battle!</b>

01:11:00.330 --> 01:11:03.130
<b>We're just going to
have to sit it out and watch.</b>

01:11:16.130 --> 01:11:19.130
<b>You keep missing!</b>

01:11:19.210 --> 01:11:20.920
<b>You're like a cockroach.</b>

01:11:22.040 --> 01:11:24.130
<b>I'm tired of the explosions!</b>

01:11:24.210 --> 01:11:26.420
<b>Chainsaw!</b>

01:11:37.210 --> 01:11:39.210
<b>-Take that!
-Ouch!</b>

01:11:41.250 --> 01:11:43.540
<b>What a waste.</b>

01:11:43.630 --> 01:11:46.210
<b>I cut off a beautiful woman's leg.</b>

01:11:46.290 --> 01:11:49.500
<b>Lady Reze! Take my blood!</b>

01:11:55.500 --> 01:11:56.960
<b>Good!</b>

01:11:57.040 --> 01:11:58.420
<b>Wait, that's not good!</b>

01:11:58.920 --> 01:12:01.960
<b>This is crazy.</b>

01:12:12.540 --> 01:12:14.080
<b>Grab on to something!</b>

01:12:14.830 --> 01:12:17.210
<b>I can't!</b>

01:12:26.420 --> 01:12:27.420
<b>It's okay.</b>

01:12:29.000 --> 01:12:31.920
<b>It's okay! You can let go!</b>

01:12:32.000 --> 01:12:35.920
<b>If I'm going to die, I don't care!
It just means today was my day to die.</b>

01:12:36.500 --> 01:12:37.920
<b>I'll be fine.</b>

01:12:38.630 --> 01:12:41.210
<b>I've been ready to die for a long time.</b>

01:13:08.420 --> 01:13:09.580
<b>Why?</b>

01:13:10.540 --> 01:13:12.420
<b>Why did you touch my hand?</b>

01:13:12.500 --> 01:13:15.250
<b>-Do you want to die?
-Of course I don't want to die!</b>

01:13:19.790 --> 01:13:22.750
<b>How much did my lifespan
decrease just now?</b>

01:13:26.330 --> 01:13:27.460
<b>About two months.</b>

01:13:34.750 --> 01:13:37.960
<b>If you want to die,
then die somewhere far away from me.</b>

01:13:39.040 --> 01:13:41.080
<b>I can't take it anymore,
watching someone die</b>

01:13:41.790 --> 01:13:43.420
<b>right in front of me.</b>

01:14:04.500 --> 01:14:06.960
<b>Lord Chainsaw!
We're in trouble! Something's coming!</b>

01:14:07.630 --> 01:14:09.540
<b>Lord Chainsaw--</b>

01:14:15.170 --> 01:14:16.170
<b>Huh?</b>

01:14:39.630 --> 01:14:41.790
<b>Lord Chainsaw!</b>

01:15:55.130 --> 01:15:56.960
<b>You were hanging in there
for a pretty long time.</b>

01:15:58.630 --> 01:15:59.830
<b>But I think it's time now...</b>

01:16:02.460 --> 01:16:03.960
<b>to put an end to this.</b>

01:16:15.290 --> 01:16:17.250
<b>That was close!</b>

01:16:18.420 --> 01:16:19.540
<b>Beam!</b>

01:16:19.630 --> 01:16:23.040
<b>Lord Chainsaw!
I'll make sure you won't regret this!</b>

01:16:33.580 --> 01:16:35.290
<b>Hey! This is bad!</b>

01:16:35.380 --> 01:16:37.750
<b>He's going to turn the whole city
into mincemeat at this rate!</b>

01:16:37.830 --> 01:16:41.580
<b>Beam! We've got to get
that fat-ass to shut up first!</b>

01:16:41.670 --> 01:16:42.750
<b>Okay!</b>

01:16:54.080 --> 01:16:56.080
<b>I found you!</b>

01:17:01.960 --> 01:17:05.580
<b>Die! Chainsaw!</b>

01:17:34.670 --> 01:17:35.830
<b>Yeah!</b>

01:17:36.540 --> 01:17:39.170
<b>Beam! Send me flying!</b>

01:17:39.960 --> 01:17:41.040
<b>Yeah!</b>

01:17:48.630 --> 01:17:51.330
<b>This makes it easy for me!</b>

01:17:51.420 --> 01:17:54.710
<b>All I have to do
is swing my chainsaws around...</b>

01:17:55.290 --> 01:17:58.420
<b>like crazy!</b>

01:18:05.040 --> 01:18:07.330
<b>Beam!</b>

01:18:07.420 --> 01:18:10.170
<b>Lord Chainsaw!</b>

01:18:28.540 --> 01:18:30.960
<b>Stay away!</b>

01:18:34.670 --> 01:18:36.040
<b>Come on!</b>

01:19:11.710 --> 01:19:13.630
<b>We did it! Beam!</b>

01:19:13.710 --> 01:19:15.250
<b>Where's Reze?</b>

01:19:17.380 --> 01:19:18.380
<b>Lord Chainsaw!</b>

01:21:05.170 --> 01:21:06.540
<b>Ouch!</b>

01:21:06.630 --> 01:21:08.170
<b>You saved me, Beam!</b>

01:21:11.290 --> 01:21:14.960
<b>Denji. Don't you think
it's about time you gave up?</b>

01:21:17.710 --> 01:21:18.710
<b>No.</b>

01:21:39.290 --> 01:21:43.250
<b>You're being a huge pain in the ass.
Just hurry up and die already.</b>

01:21:43.880 --> 01:21:49.130
<b>Then you should have just
killed me when we first met!</b>

01:21:51.250 --> 01:21:52.750
<b>There's nowhere left to run.</b>

01:21:53.500 --> 01:21:54.750
<b>I wouldn't be so sure about that.</b>

01:21:55.380 --> 01:21:58.960
<b>You shouldn't have taught me how to swim.</b>

01:21:59.830 --> 01:22:01.710
<b>You're going to swim?</b>

01:22:31.080 --> 01:22:32.500
<b>Chains?</b>

01:22:51.830 --> 01:22:55.960
<b>Can you still explode when you're wet?</b>

01:24:43.960 --> 01:24:45.460
<b>I can't believe it.</b>

01:24:46.500 --> 01:24:48.920
<b>Why did you resurrect me?</b>

01:24:51.290 --> 01:24:54.040
<b>I have a great life.</b>

01:24:54.710 --> 01:24:58.710
<b>No matter how many times
I get beat up or die,</b>

01:24:58.790 --> 01:25:02.380
<b>as long as I get to eat good food
the next day, I can forgive.</b>

01:25:03.750 --> 01:25:04.750
<b>But...</b>

01:25:06.210 --> 01:25:09.210
<b>if I capture you and hand you over
to Public Safety,</b>

01:25:09.790 --> 01:25:13.710
<b>I'd feel like I had a fish bone
stuck in my throat.</b>

01:25:17.880 --> 01:25:20.500
<b>Even if I were living
a good life every day,</b>

01:25:20.580 --> 01:25:23.880
<b>it would feel bad, having something
poking the back of my throat.</b>

01:25:29.290 --> 01:25:32.790
<b>Do you think you would still say that
if I killed you right now?</b>

01:25:34.750 --> 01:25:36.670
<b>If someone's going to kill me,</b>

01:25:36.750 --> 01:25:38.290
<b>then I'd rather be killed
by a beautiful woman.</b>

01:25:52.210 --> 01:25:57.290
<b>Do you really still believe
that I like you for real?</b>

01:25:58.420 --> 01:26:02.790
<b>The look on my face when I met you,
and the way I blushed... It was all a lie.</b>

01:26:03.710 --> 01:26:05.710
<b>I just trained myself how to do it.</b>

01:26:07.170 --> 01:26:09.250
<b>I failed.</b>

01:26:09.790 --> 01:26:12.540
<b>I took too much time before I fought you.</b>

01:26:14.170 --> 01:26:16.500
<b>I'm going to run away now.</b>

01:26:23.250 --> 01:26:24.630
<b>Do you want to run away together?</b>

01:26:28.170 --> 01:26:31.210
<b>I can fight too.
You'll have a better chance at escaping.</b>

01:26:33.290 --> 01:26:36.040
<b>I killed lots of people.</b>

01:26:36.130 --> 01:26:40.960
<b>If you let me get away,
that would make you complicit in murder.</b>

01:26:41.500 --> 01:26:43.040
<b>Do you understand what that means?</b>

01:26:45.830 --> 01:26:48.170
<b>I know I shouldn't,
but I've got no choice.</b>

01:26:48.670 --> 01:26:50.210
<b>I still like you.</b>

01:26:51.330 --> 01:26:53.170
<b>You said it was all a lie.</b>

01:26:53.250 --> 01:26:56.250
<b>But you did teach me how to swim. Right?</b>

01:27:38.460 --> 01:27:39.670
<b>Hey!</b>

01:27:39.750 --> 01:27:42.630
<b>You should learn to be smarter.</b>

01:27:42.710 --> 01:27:45.290
<b>Reze! Hey, Reze!</b>

01:27:50.960 --> 01:27:55.380
<b>I'm going to be waiting
at the café at lunch!</b>

01:27:55.460 --> 01:27:57.130
<b>You'd better—</b>

01:28:01.250 --> 01:28:04.170
<b>Get up, Beam! My hand won't move!</b>

01:28:05.330 --> 01:28:07.080
<b>Rev up my engine!</b>

01:28:51.630 --> 01:28:54.960
<b><i>There's a fairy tale that mothers</i>
<i>in the Soviet Union tell</i></b>

01:28:55.080 --> 01:28:56.080
<b><i>when scolding their children.</i></b>

01:28:57.210 --> 01:29:03.580
<b><i>The story says that there's a secret room</i>
<i>in the military's munitions storehouse.</i></b>

01:29:03.670 --> 01:29:05.580
<b>And the secret room is filled
with orphans.</b>

01:29:08.790 --> 01:29:11.130
<b>The kids who live there
don't have any freedom.</b>

01:29:11.210 --> 01:29:12.920
<b>They're not allowed to go outside.</b>

01:29:13.920 --> 01:29:15.460
<b>They're treated like objects.</b>

01:29:15.540 --> 01:29:18.460
<b>And the military uses their bodies
for experiments until they die.</b>

01:29:19.080 --> 01:29:21.630
<b>It was supposed to be just a fairy tale.</b>

01:29:22.130 --> 01:29:26.330
<b>But one day, a newspaper reported that
that secret room really did exist.</b>

01:29:27.210 --> 01:29:29.250
<b><i>An American journalist was the one</i>
<i>who uncovered the story.</i></b>

01:29:29.330 --> 01:29:31.210
<b><i>It was all over the news.</i></b>

01:29:31.710 --> 01:29:35.170
<b><i>They published photos</i>
<i>of the children who were there.</i></b>

01:29:35.670 --> 01:29:37.460
<b><i>But the story soon disappeared.</i></b>

01:29:38.040 --> 01:29:41.210
<b><i>The girl who lured Denji in</i>
<i>was one of the kids from that room.</i></b>

01:29:41.290 --> 01:29:42.330
<b>TYPHOON DEVIL DAMAGE
RELIEF FUND</b>

01:29:42.420 --> 01:29:43.880
<b>YOUR SUPPORT AND COOPERATION
ARE APPRECIATED</b>

01:29:44.960 --> 01:29:48.630
<b>A fighter created by the Soviet Union
to serve their country.</b>

01:29:52.460 --> 01:29:55.960
<b><i>They're called guinea pigs.</i></b>

01:29:58.920 --> 01:30:03.380
<b><i>The Yamabiko train bound for Sendai</i>
<i>will soon depart from Platform 12.</i></b>

01:30:04.170 --> 01:30:06.170
<b><i>The next stop will be Ueno.</i></b>

01:30:06.250 --> 01:30:07.330
<b><i>The train will now depart.</i></b>

01:30:07.420 --> 01:30:09.330
<b><i>This is the Yamabiko train</i>
<i>bound for Sendai.</i></b>

01:30:09.880 --> 01:30:12.420
<b><i>The train will now depart.</i>
<i>Doors are closing.</i></b>

01:30:12.500 --> 01:30:14.500
<b><i>Please stand clear of the closing doors.</i></b>

01:31:27.210 --> 01:31:28.210
<b>Me too.</b>

01:31:30.920 --> 01:31:33.420
<b>I like the country mouse too.</b>

01:31:35.960 --> 01:31:39.330
<b>One of my friends has a field
in the countryside.</b>

01:31:40.210 --> 01:31:44.040
<b>I go there to help out my friend
every year in the fall.</b>

01:31:45.330 --> 01:31:50.040
<b>The field has mice hiding in the soil
that damage the crops.</b>

01:31:50.960 --> 01:31:55.080
<b>We have to exterminate the mice
before the fields get covered in snow.</b>

01:31:55.670 --> 01:32:01.130
<b>So we dig up the fields and have the dogs
kill the mice hiding inside.</b>

01:32:02.330 --> 01:32:03.540
<b>I wonder why...</b>

01:32:04.380 --> 01:32:05.960
<b>whenever I watch...</b>

01:32:07.420 --> 01:32:08.920
<b>I feel so comforted.</b>

01:32:14.380 --> 01:32:16.500
<b>That's why I like the country mouse.</b>

01:32:52.290 --> 01:32:53.380
<b><i>Why...</i></b>

01:32:54.420 --> 01:32:57.880
<b><i>I wonder why I didn't kill you</i>
<i>the first time we met.</i></b>

01:32:59.210 --> 01:33:02.250
<b><i>Denji, to be honest...</i></b>

01:33:03.960 --> 01:33:07.080
<b><i>I've never been to school either.</i></b>

01:33:20.210 --> 01:33:23.290
<b>I told you to come with Hayakawa.</b>

01:33:23.790 --> 01:33:27.380
<b>You didn't want to make
Hayakawa kill a girl.</b>

01:33:28.330 --> 01:33:29.540
<b>You're so kind.</b>

01:33:30.540 --> 01:33:32.960
<b>It's because I'm an angel.</b>

01:33:44.170 --> 01:33:45.170
<b>Hey.</b>

01:33:46.080 --> 01:33:47.750
<b>Is the city a good place?</b>

01:37:55.420 --> 01:37:58.460
<b>Denji. I've got to close the café now.</b>

01:38:00.040 --> 01:38:01.880
<b>That girl was too cute.</b>

01:38:02.540 --> 01:38:04.420
<b>She was from a different world.</b>

01:38:06.210 --> 01:38:10.000
<b>I'm sure you'll meet a girl
who's perfect for you someday.</b>

01:38:21.040 --> 01:38:22.790
<b>RECOMMENDATIONS</b>

01:38:36.580 --> 01:38:39.250
<b>Power!</b>

01:38:40.830 --> 01:38:45.380
<b>I'm back! I tracked you down
by following your scent.</b>

01:38:46.250 --> 01:38:48.750
<b>What a tiny café!</b>

01:38:58.250 --> 01:39:00.130
<b>What are you doing with those flowers?</b>

01:39:00.210 --> 01:39:03.750
<b>They would really suit me!
Give them to me!</b>

01:39:18.250 --> 01:39:22.580
<b>Hey! Don't eat them!
They're mine! You thief!</b>

01:39:22.670 --> 01:39:24.630
<b>You idiot!</b>

01:39:24.710 --> 01:39:26.420
<b>Spit them out right now!</b>

01:39:26.920 --> 01:39:30.750
<b>Spit them out! Spit them out!</b>
